WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.418
A global ORDER BY can be expensive in Spark because
the entire result needs a

00:00:04.445 --> 00:00:11.767
coordinated order That may be necessary for a final
report It

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:17.440
is often unnecessary in intermediate transformations
Sort only when the order

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:19.388
is part of the actual requirement
